From 0561298aa00dd9bb86997e8ac24e1d47ea9b38da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 May 2021 23:48:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] New Lotus sighash (#176)

This replaces and renames the BIP341 sighash introduced two months ago.

It allows smart contracts to more easily access parts of the transaction, e.g. by hashing the inputs/outputs in a merkle tree.

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: bc3f5eebe50087ad71f06020a81cbadcc1d7ebfc
Recorded-replay-commit: 7dbb7abef1974afffa7ab1487a0e4f6b7c1de496

